1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,804
We create a blue circle at the center.

2
00:00:02,933 --> 00:00:05,785
Now it shifts two units to the right.

3
00:00:05,933 --> 00:00:08,329
Then it moves up two units.

4
00:00:08,466 --> 00:00:11,414
Now it shifts four units to the left.

5
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:14,721
Finally, it moves down two units.

6
00:00:14,866 --> 00:00:19,590
Shift moves objects by a relative amount from their current position.

